{"t":"VLO","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Valero Energy Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Refining & Marketing","employees":9785,"hq":"San Antonio, TX, United States","website":"https://www.valero.com","summary_en":"Valero Energy Corporation manufactures, markets, and sells petroleum-based and low-carbon liquid transportation fuels and petrochemical products in the United States, Canada, the United Kingdom, Ireland, Latin America, Mexico, Peru, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Refining, Renewable Diesel, and Ethanol. The company produces California Reformulated Gasoline Blendstock for Oxygenate Blending (CARBOB) and Conventional Blendstock for Oxygenate Blending (CBOB) gasolines, CARB diesel, diesel, jet fuel, heating oil, and asphalt; feedstocks; aromatics; sulfur and residual fuel oil; intermediate oils; and sulfur, sweet, and sour crude oils. It sells its refined products through wholesale rack and bulk markets; and through outlets under the Valero, Beacon, Diamond Shamrock, Shamrock, Ultramar, and Texaco brands. The company also owns and operates renewable diesel and ethanol plants, as well as produces and sells renewable diesel, renewable naphtha, and neat sustainable aviation fuel under the Diamond Green Diesel brand name. In addition, it offers ethanol and various co-products, including dry distillers grains, syrup, and inedible distillers corn oil to animal feed customers. The company was formerly known as Valero Refining and Marketing Company and changed its name to Valero Energy Corporation in August 1997. Valero Energy Corporation was founded in 1980 and is headquartered in San Antonio, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Valero Energy Corporation은 미국, 캐나다, 영국, 아일랜드, 라틴 아메리카, 멕시코, 페루 및 국제적으로 석유 기반 및 저탄소 액체 운송 연료와 석유화학 제품을 제조, 판매 및 판매합니다. 정제, 재생 디젤, 에탄올의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 CARBOB(산소 혼합용 캘리포니아 개질 가솔린 혼합 원료) 및 CBOB(산소 혼합 원료) 가솔린, CARB 디젤, 디젤, 제트 연료, 난방유 및 아스팔트를 생산합니다. 공급원료; 방향족; 황 및 잔류 연료유; 중간유; 유황, 감미롭고 신맛이 나는 원유. 도매 랙 및 벌크 시장을 통해 정제된 제품을 판매합니다. Valero, Beacon, Diamond Shamrock, Shamrock, Ultramar 및 Texaco 브랜드의 매장을 통해 판매됩니다. 이 회사는 또한 재생 가능한 디젤 및 에탄올 공장을 소유 및 운영할 뿐만 아니라 Diamond Green Diesel 브랜드 이름으로 재생 가능한 디젤, 재생 가능한 나프타 및 깔끔하고 지속 가능한 항공 연료를 생산 및 판매합니다. 또한, 에탄올과 건식 증류 곡물, 시럽, 비식용 증류 옥수수유 등 다양한 부산물을 동물 사료 고객에게 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Valero Refining and Marketing Company로 알려져 있었으며 1997년 8월에 Valero Energy Corporation으로 이름을 변경했습니다. Valero Energy Corporation은 1980년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 샌안토니오에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":351.23,"mcap":97952579584.0,"pe":7.9879465,"fpe":6.565713,"peg":1.3694,"ps":0.668486,"pb":3.5015852,"ev_ebitda":4.927,"div":1.37,"beta":0.552,"hi52":461.52,"lo52":159.9},"fin":{"rev":146528993280.0,"rev_g":0.465,"eps_g":5.768,"gross":0.19519,"op":0.20472999,"net":0.08834,"roe":0.46872002,"fcf":12579375104.0,"cash":9840000000.0,"debt":11000999936.0,"de":35.391,"eps":43.97,"feps":53.49457},"own":{"short":0.0335,"inst":0.89501,"insider":0.00438},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":427.0,"median":440.0,"high":530.0,"low":238.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.5,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":3,"buy":6,"hold":8,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":3,"buy":6,"hold":8,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":6,"hold":9,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":7,"hold":8,"sell":2,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Morgan Stanley","ToGrade":"Equal-Weight","FromGrade":"Equal-Weight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":420.0,"priorPriceTarget":411.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Freedom Broker","ToGrade":"Sell","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"down","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":276.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":490.0,"priorPriceTarget":485.0},{"GradeDate":